        "A": "3.3",
        "B": "4.2",
        "C": "5.6",
        "D": "7.6"
      },
      "correct_answer": "D",
      "solution_steps": [
        "Con marcas de clase 5,7,9 y frecuencias 2,3,5, la media estimada es (10+21+45)/10=7.6 horas."
